{"seq":3,"slug":"precursor-material-emissions-allocation","title":"前体材料排放归集与分配规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cbam-embedded-emissions-reporting/embedded-emissions-calc/precursor-material-emissions-allocation","wordCount":3498,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"前体材料排放归集与分配规则\">前体材料排放归集与分配规则</h1><p>同一座高炉出的铁水，一部分直接铸成生铁块出口、一部分送进转炉炼成粗钢：两件 CBAM 货物共享同一批烧结矿前体，而烧结矿自己的嵌入式排放要按什么权重、在哪个时点、分给谁——这些选择决定了每吨粗钢的 SEE 里究竟含着多少来自上游的碳。前体不是&quot;再加一项上游数据&quot;那么简单，它引入的是一个<strong>跨企业、跨期间、跨生产路线</strong>的归集与分配问题。系统边界篇（<a href=\"embedded-emissions-system-boundary\">嵌入式排放的系统边界与直接/间接划分</a>）回答了&quot;哪些前体进界、按哪一类别进&quot;；本篇回答&quot;进来之后<strong>怎么归、怎么分</strong>&quot;，也就是 Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2025/2547（业界称 Methodology Act）第 14、15 条与 Annex III 所规定的那套运算结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-归集-分配与加权平均三件事\">核心概念：归集、分配与加权平均三件事</h2><p>前体排放处理容易被误做成&quot;把上游排放量加进成品&quot;，但方法论要求的是一套有严格顺序的核算。先固定五个关键概念：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>系统建模要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>归集（aggregation）</td>\n<td>同一前体来自多个来源/期间时，先合并成一个排放值</td>\n<td>按消耗量加权平均，记录每个来源的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SEE</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 与版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分配（allocation）</td>\n<td>把一批前体的排放按规则分到消耗它的多个产出/货物</td>\n<td>选定物理可辩护的分配键，且同一层级全程一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分配键（allocation key）</td>\n<td>分配所依据的量（质量、当量、能量等）</td>\n<td>优先与排放因果相关；键值需可计量、可审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统边界一致性</td>\n<td>前体进界类别与直接/间接口径必须和系统边界篇一致</td>\n<td>复用同一 SEE 定义，不重复计、不漏计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期间匹配</td>\n<td>前体排放归属到其被实际消耗的报告期</td>\n<td>用库存流转（加权平均）处理期初库存与跨期采购</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三条不变量贯穿全篇：其一，<strong>加权平均守恒</strong>——合并前后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum m\\cdot SEE</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 不变，分配后各产出分到的排放之和等于该批前体总排放；其二，<strong>同一分配键在同一安装、同一产品族内不可逐货切换</strong>，否则可人为把碳排到低门槛品类；其三，<strong>前体递归有界</strong>——沿供应链向下追溯到方法论规定的前体层级为止，末端缺失数据按默认值规则处理而非无限递归。常见误解是把&quot;分配比例&quot;当作可调的财务分摊；它在 CBAM 下是物理核算动作，必须能被第三方核查复算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归集的第一层-一批前体可能有多个来源\">归集的第一层：一批前体可能有多个来源</h2><p>前体在法规里的定义很窄也很宽——基础法规 Regulation (EU) 2023/956 第 1(7) 条把前体定义为**&quot;投入生产过程、且本身列在 Annex I 货物清单里的任何输入物料&quot;<strong>。正式期取消了过渡期&quot;聚合货物类别下列出相关前体&quot;的白名单做法，也取消了&quot;质量或合金含量超过 5% 才须计入&quot;的门槛，因此</strong>任何 CBAM 货物都可以是另一生产过程的前体**（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2025/2547/oj\">Methodology Act (EU) 2025/2547</a>）。</p>\n<p>这个定义直接决定了归集的第一层难点：一件复合货物在报告期内消耗的前体，往往不是来自单一来源。炼一吨粗钢用的生铁可能一部分来自自建高炉、一部分从外部采购；采购来的生铁又可能来自两个不同国家的两家厂。Methodology Act 第 14(1)–(2) 条给出的默认规则是：<strong>来自不同报告期或不同安装的同一前体，通常按加权平均合并成一个前体排放值</strong>。写成公式，若报告期内某前体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个来源，各自消耗量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_{p,i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、各自的特定嵌入式排放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SEE_{p,i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SEE_p = \\frac{\\sum_i m_{p,i} \\cdot SEE_{p,i}}{\\sum_i m_{p,i}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加权平均是<strong>默认值</strong>，不是唯一解。第 14(3) 条留了一个口子：如果能提供证据，证明该批货物<strong>只用了某一个来源、或一个明确界定的来源子集</strong>，就允许把该来源的前体排放<strong>单独归属</strong>给这批货物。这个口子的实操含义是：物理上可追溯（同一批次、同一供应商、有物料平衡与仓储记录支撑）的企业，可以拿到更低的 SEE；做不到批次级追溯的企业，只能吃加权平均。<strong>追踪粒度在这里第一次变成了可量化的钱</strong>——它不是数据治理的口号，而是直接改写分母之上的分子。</p>\n<p>跨期加权还有一个容易忽略的后果：前体被推定为<strong>与复合货物在同一日历年内生产</strong>。如果实际采购来自上一年度、但系统按当年默认期归集，就会把不同年度的电网碳强度或工艺排放掺进同一个平均值。落地时必须在台账里显式记录每个前体批次的<strong>生产期</strong>字段，而不能只记采购期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前体排放如何进入复合货物的-see\">前体排放如何进入复合货物的 SEE</h2><p>归集解决&quot;每个前体的 SEE 是多少&quot;，分配解决&quot;它怎样进入成品&quot;。基础法规 Annex IV 与 Methodology Act Annex I 第 3.1 点给出的结构是：复合货物的特定嵌入式排放，等于<strong>归属到该生产过程的排放，加上为生产该功能单位货物所需的前体排放，再除以活动水平</strong>。展开写：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SEE_g = \\frac{E_g^{attr} + \\sum_{p \\in P(g)} m_{p} \\cdot SEE_{p}}{AL_g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6304em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8647em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4747em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_g^{attr}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是归属到生产过程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 的直接与（视货物类别）间接排放，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是生产一单位货物所耗前体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的质量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(g)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是货物 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 的全部前体集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AL_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是活动水平（一般以吨计，电力以 kWh、化肥以氮千克、部分水泥以熟料吨计）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[成品货物 g] --&gt; B[归属排放 E_attr&lt;br/&gt;燃烧+工艺+外购热/冷]&#10;    A --&gt; C[前体集合 P_g]&#10;    C --&gt; D{同一前体有几个来源?}&#10;    D --&gt;|单一来源 且可追溯| E[单独归属&lt;br/&gt;Art 14-3]&#10;    D --&gt;|多来源 或不可追溯| F[加权平均合并&lt;br/&gt;Art 14-1/2]&#10;    C --&gt; G{前体是否自建安装内产?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是 且未发生转移| H[联合生产过程&lt;br/&gt;Art 4-9 合并监测]&#10;    G --&gt;|否 外购| I[按供应商实际值&lt;br/&gt;或默认值]&#10;    C --&gt; J{前体在 EU/列明地区产?}&#10;    J --&gt;|是| K[SEE 按零计]&#10;    J --&gt;|否| L[按上式计入]&#10;    E --&gt; M[Σ m_p · SEE_p]&#10;    F --&gt; M&#10;    H --&gt; M&#10;    I --&gt; M&#10;    K --&gt; M&#10;    L --&gt; M&#10;    B --&gt; N[SEE_g = E_attr + Σ 前体 / AL_g]&#10;    M --&gt; N\">graph TD\n    A[成品货物 g] --&gt; B[归属排放 E_attr&lt;br/&gt;燃烧+工艺+外购热/冷]\n    A --&gt; C[前体集合 P_g]\n    C --&gt; D{同一前体有几个来源?}\n    D --&gt;|单一来源 且可追溯| E[单独归属&lt;br/&gt;Art 14-3]\n    D --&gt;|多来源 或不可追溯| F[加权平均合并&lt;br/&gt;Art 14-1/2]\n    C --&gt; G{前体是否自建安装内产?}\n    G --&gt;|是 且未发生转移| H[联合生产过程&lt;br/&gt;Art 4-9 合并监测]\n    G --&gt;|否 外购| I[按供应商实际值&lt;br/&gt;或默认值]\n    C --&gt; J{前体在 EU/列明地区产?}\n    J --&gt;|是| K[SEE 按零计]\n    J --&gt;|否| L[按上式计入]\n    E --&gt; M[Σ m_p · SEE_p]\n    F --&gt; M\n    H --&gt; M\n    I --&gt; M\n    K --&gt; M\n    L --&gt; M\n    B --&gt; N[SEE_g = E_attr + Σ 前体 / AL_g]\n    M --&gt; N</pre><p>这张图里有三个分叉需要单独解释：<strong>联合生产</strong>、<strong>多产出分摊</strong>、<strong>EU 产前体按零计</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"联合生产过程与多产出分摊-同一厂内的前体怎么算\">联合生产过程与多产出分摊：同一厂内的前体怎么算</h2><p>当<strong>前体与复合货物在同一个安装内生产、且中间不发生商业转移</strong>时，Methodology Act 第 4(9) 条允许把它们作为一个**联合生产过程（joint production process）**合并监测，而不必给内部流转的烧结矿、铁水单独算一个 SEE 再回填。这条规则的工程价值很高：它避免了在厂内人为制造&quot;内部交易价&quot;，也避免了把共用装置排放先分摊到中间品、再分摊回成品的双重分摊误差。</p>\n<p>但联合生产不能用来规避<strong>多产出分摊</strong>。Annex III 的 A.2 与 A.4 点专门处理<strong>多功能过程（multifunctional process）</strong>——即一个生产过程同时产出多种货物（如高炉同时产生铁与高炉煤气、炼油同时出多种馏分）。此时排放必须按可核验的分配基准分给各产出，而不能全部压给主产品。第 4(6) 条补齐另一条规则：<strong>当同一个功能单位存在多条生产路线时</strong>（例如粗钢既走转炉路线又走电弧炉路线），应采用单一过程并对各路线产出取<strong>加权平均</strong>，而不是按路线分别维护两套 SEE。把这两条合起来看，正式期的分配哲学是一句话：<strong>在能唯一确定的地方用实际归属，在共享的地方用可核验的加权平均，且不允许把可归属的排放藏进平均值里稀释</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>条款依据</th>\n<th>系统含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前体多来源、不可批次追溯</td>\n<td>按消耗量加权平均</td>\n<td>Art. 14(1)–(2)</td>\n<td>前体表须存每个来源的量与 SEE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前体单一来源、有证据</td>\n<td>允许单独归属</td>\n<td>Art. 14(3)</td>\n<td>台账须支持批次级物料平衡举证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前体与成品同厂、无转移</td>\n<td>合并为联合生产过程</td>\n<td>Art. 4(9)</td>\n<td>内部流转不生成中间 SEE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一个过程多产出</td>\n<td>按可核验基准分摊</td>\n<td>Annex III A.2/A.4</td>\n<td>分摊基准须写入监测计划</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一个功能单位多路线</td>\n<td>单过程 + 产出加权平均</td>\n<td>Art. 4(6)</td>\n<td>路线数据可合流，不可重复计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前体产于 EU 或列明地区</td>\n<td>SEE 按零计</td>\n<td>基础法规 Annex IV</td>\n<td>前体表须带生产地字段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实测值与默认值在同一批前体上混用\">实测值与默认值在同一批前体上混用</h2><p>归集与分配之外，第 15 条还留了一个务实的接口：<strong>实际值与默认值可以混用</strong>——对自产（in-house）过程用实际值，对一个或多个外购前体用默认值。这条规则的存在，是因为供应链数据的可得性在链条上并不均匀：钢铁厂对自己高炉的排放了如指掌，对上游铁合金厂或外购氢气的实际值却常常拿不到。</p>\n<p>混用的边界在<strong>默认值占用比的上限</strong>。正式期规定：<strong>简单货物</strong>在能证明实际值确实无法充分确定时方可使用默认值；<strong>复杂货物</strong>的默认值最多只能覆盖其总嵌入式排放的 <strong>20%</strong>，其余至少 80% 必须来自实际值。这条 20% 上限让&quot;混用&quot;从一种偷懒变成一种需要精算的取舍：系统必须在核算过程中持续累加&quot;默认值贡献的排放 ÷ 总嵌入式排放&quot;，一旦越界就必须退回要么补齐实际值、要么更换供应商。核算路径的完整规则见同 hub 的<a href=\"actual-value-vs-default-value-method\">实际值法与默认值法核算路径</a>。</p>\n<p>另一个与分配强相关的规则是<strong>EU 产前体按零计</strong>：在 EU 境内或列明地区生产、已在其 EU ETS 下承担过碳成本的前体，进入复合货物时 SEE 按零计入，以避免同一吨碳被征收两次。对做跨境电商进口申报的系统而言，这意味着前体表必须携带**生产地（EU / 非 EU）**字段，并且该字段会影响最终数值——漏掉它会造成系统性高估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地-把归集与分配做成一条可复算的管线\">工程落地：把归集与分配做成一条可复算的管线</h2><p>前体的归集与分配天然是<strong>图上的递归计算</strong>：一件粗钢的前体是生铁，生铁的前体是烧结矿与焦炭，逐层展开直到叶子节点（其排放来自燃烧与工艺本身）。最稳的实现是把这条链建成<strong>可复算的 DAG</strong>，而不是写死在业务代码里的分支。</p>\n<p>四个设计要点。其一，<strong>把前体台账建成事实表</strong>：每条记录 =（成品过程、前体 CN 编码、来源安装、生产期、数量、SEE 值、是实际值还是默认值、生产地）。加权平均与单独归属都只是这张表上的聚合函数，切换规则不需要改结构。其二，<strong>给每个前体值打上来源与方法标签</strong>，这样&quot;实际值占比&quot;可以沿链累加——默认值上限的校验必须是全局的，不能在每个前体局部判断。其三，<strong>缓存中间 SEE 并记录其版本与输入哈希</strong>，因为上层成品的前体 SEE 一旦被核查推翻，下游所有成品的数值都需要重算，缓存失效必须沿 DAG 向上传播。其四，<strong>把分摊基准与联合生产判定写入监测计划</strong>，让每个分配决定都能被核查员逐条质询——分配不是一个隐式的算术细节，而是可被质询的技术契约。</p>\n<p>三类常见失败模式值得提前设防：把多来源前体简单取算术平均（忽略消耗量加权，系统性偏离）；对厂内流转的中间品重复计算（联合生产过程未启用，导致双重分摊）；以及在前体表里丢掉生产地与生产期字段（分别导致 EU 前体高估与跨期污染）。这三者的共同预防手段，是让<strong>每个前体排放值都携带来源、方法、生产期、生产地四个属性</strong>，使其在规则变化时可被重新解释而不必重录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>前体材料的归集与分配，是把上游供应链的碳数据翻译成复合货物 SEE 的一套加权与分摊规则，落点在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SEE_g = (E_g^{attr} + \\sum_p m_p \\cdot SEE_p) / AL_g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7936em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>归集的默认是加权平均</strong>：跨来源、跨安装、跨报告期的同一前体按消耗量加权合并；只有能举证&quot;仅用某一来源或明确子集&quot;时才允许单独归属（Art. 14）。</li>\n<li><strong>同一安装内不转移的前体与成品可合并为联合生产过程</strong>（Art. 4(9)），避免内部流转产生伪中间 SEE；多功能过程与多路线则分别按可核验基准分摊（Annex III A.2/A.4）与产出加权平均（Art. 4(6)）。</li>\n<li><strong>实际值与默认值可在同一批前体上混用</strong>（Art. 15），但复杂货物的默认值占比受 20% 上限约束，系统须全局累加而非局部判断。</li>\n<li><strong>EU 或列明地区生产的前体按零计</strong>，前体台账必须带生产地字段。</li>\n<li><strong>每个前体值应携带来源、方法、生产期、生产地四个属性</strong>，使归集与分配成为可复算、可重解释的 DAG 运算。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本篇处理&quot;进来之后怎么归、怎么分&quot;；前体为什么进界、按直接还是间接类别进，见<a href=\"embedded-emissions-system-boundary\">嵌入式排放的系统边界与直接/间接划分</a>。落地时务必以 Methodology Act（EU 2025/2547）当期文本、委员会 <a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/carbon-border-adjustment-mechanism/cbam-legislation-and-guidance_en\">Guidance Document No. 3（2026 年 8 月 14 日）及其行业分册 5d 钢铁 / 5e 铝</a> 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前体材料排放归集与分配规则","id":"前体材料排放归集与分配规则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：归集、分配与加权平均三件事","id":"核心概念-归集-分配与加权平均三件事"},{"level":2,"text":"归集的第一层：一批前体可能有多个来源","id":"归集的第一层-一批前体可能有多个来源"},{"level":2,"text":"前体排放如何进入复合货物的 SEE","id":"前体排放如何进入复合货物的-see"},{"level":2,"text":"联合生产过程与多产出分摊：同一厂内的前体怎么算","id":"联合生产过程与多产出分摊-同一厂内的前体怎么算"},{"level":2,"text":"实测值与默认值在同一批前体上混用","id":"实测值与默认值在同一批前体上混用"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地：把归集与分配做成一条可复算的管线","id":"工程落地-把归集与分配做成一条可复算的管线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实际值法与默认值法核算路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cbam-embedded-emissions-reporting/embedded-emissions-calc/actual-value-vs-default-value-method"},"next":{"title":"供应商排放数据采集与沟通模板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cbam-embedded-emissions-reporting/cbam-data-collection-verification/supplier-emissions-data-collection"}}